12. GROQ AI ROLE
==================================================

Groq is NOT being used for embeddings.

Groq is the reasoning/analysis layer.

Its job is to understand raw societal problem submissions and convert them into structured information.

The AI extracts:

- summary
- domain
- severity
- affected_people
- keywords
- required_expertise

Example:

Raw problem:

Title:
Irregular water supply

Description:
Our village receives water only twice a week.

Groq returns approximately:

{
    "summary": "Village receives water only twice a week, leading to water scarcity and health risks.",
    "domain": "Infrastructure",
    "severity": "HIGH",
    "affected_people": "Village residents",
    "keywords": [
        "water supply",
        "irregular",
        "village",
        "Jharkhand",
        "water scarcity"
    ],
    "required_expertise": [
        "Civil Engineering",
        "Water Resources Management",
        "Public Policy"
    ]
}

The actual output has been successfully generated by Groq.

Groq output is forced into JSON using:

response_format={"type": "json_object"}

The code uses json.loads() to convert the response into a Python object.


