It generates:
384-dimensional embeddings.

Embedding flow:

Text
→ Sentence Transformer
→ 384 numbers
→ pgvector VECTOR(384)

We initially embedded the whole problem.

Later we improved the approach.

The current matching approach focuses on the AI-generated required expertise rather than generic problem text.

Example:

